@startuml
title OID4VCI 발급

autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Holder as holder
participant "Wallet" as wallet

box "Issuer" #EEF7FF
participant "Authorization Server" as auth
participant "OID4VCI SDK" as vci
participant "Formatter SDK\n(SD-JWT VC / mDoc)" as formatter
end box

holder -> vci: 발급 시작 요청\n(userId, grantType)

alt Pre-Authorized Code Flow
    vci -> auth: Pre-Authorized Code 요청
    auth --> vci: pre-authorized_code, tx_code
    vci -> vci: request_id(p*)와 code 저장
else Authorization Code Flow
    vci -> vci: issuer_state 저장\nrequest_id(a*) 생성
end

vci --> holder: Credential Offer URI / QR
holder -> wallet: QR 또는 URI 전달

wallet -> vci: GET /credential-offer/{request_id}\n또는 credential_offer 직접 사용
vci -> vci: Offer 정보 조회 및 생성
vci --> wallet: Credential Offer\n(issuer, configuration_ids, grants)

alt Pre-Authorized Code Flow
    wallet -> auth: POST /token\npre-authorized_code, tx_code
else Authorization Code Flow
    wallet -> auth: Authorization Request / Login
    auth --> wallet: authorization_code
    wallet -> auth: POST /token\nauthorization_code
end

auth --> wallet: access_token, c_nonce

opt c_nonce 재발급 필요
    wallet -> vci: POST /nonce
    vci -> vci: c_nonce 생성 및 저장
    vci --> wallet: c_nonce
end

wallet -> wallet: Holder Binding Proof 생성\nJWT / DI-VP / Attestation
wallet -> vci: POST /credential\nBearer access_token, CredentialRequest
vci -> vci: access_token, c_nonce, proof,\nconfiguration/identifier 검증
vci -> formatter: Credential 생성 요청\nclaims, issuer key, proof jwk
formatter --> vci: Credential\nSD-JWT VC / mDoc 등
vci --> wallet: CredentialResponse\n또는 202 Deferred(transaction_id)

opt Deferred 발급
    wallet -> vci: POST /deferred_credential\ntransaction_id
    vci -> formatter: 지연 Credential 생성/조회
    formatter --> vci: Credential
    vci --> wallet: CredentialResponse
end

wallet -> vci: POST /notification\ncredential_accepted 등
vci --> wallet: 200 OK / 204 No Content

@enduml
